<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>KPOP Demon Hunter Prompts</title>
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen,
          Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Fira Sans", "Droid Sans", "Helvetica Neue", Arial,
          sans-serif;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #111827;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 28px 16px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
        letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .field {
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .field label {
        display: block;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .name {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #374151;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .prompt-box {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 160px;
        color: #111827;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas,
          "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .prompt-box code {
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <header>
        <div>
          <h1>KPOP Demon Hunter Prompts</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Developer-only reference page (edit this file to update prompts).</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 1</label>
        <div class="name">Name:</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box"></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 2</label>
        <div class="name">Name: Megan</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box">As different characters in the show "Kpop Demon hunters" from Netflix, please describe the stages of wine-making for someone who doesn't know anything about wine but loves the show Kpop Demon Hunters. Please break it up into numbered steps, with a few sentences each. Each step should be in the personality of a different character from Kpop Demon hunters and it should say their name. Please only use the the main characters, in their personality, telling the steps of how to make wine. Example output: Step 1: Harvesting Kpop demon hunter character: Jinu Harvesting process: (add a few sentences here)</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 3</label>
        <div class="name">Name:</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box"></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 4</label>
        <div class="name">Name:</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box"></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 5</label>
        <div class="name">Name:</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box"></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
